---
import ButtonOpenChat from "../../ButtonOpenChat.astro";
import ImgLogoExample from "../../../assets/logoexample.png";

// Static AI chat simulation component
---
<style>
  .chat-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 6px; width: 6px; }
  .chat-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-radius: 999px; }
  .chat-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background-color: transparent; }
  dialog.chat-dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); }
</style>



<section class="py-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-400/30 via-pink-500/20 to-cyan-400/20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white text-center">Imagínalo y créalo</h2>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-200 text-center mt-2 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Con el diseño empezamos todo. Es el pilar más valioso: clarifica la visión, reduce riesgos y acelera resultados.</p>
      <div class="mt-8">
          <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <!-- Chat completo -->
            <div class="bg-gray-900/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-4 md:p-6 flex flex-col">
              <div class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-2 font-semibold">Chat de diseño</div>
              <!-- Preset prompt tags / checks -->
              <div class="mb-3">
                <p class="text-white font-semibold">Crea tu idea en unos segundos</p>
                <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  <button class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs bg-gray-800/70 border border-gray-700 text-gray-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition" aria-pressed="false">
                    <span class="inline-flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-500 text-white text-[10px]">✓</span>
                    Diseño 2D
                  </button>
                  <button class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs bg-gray-800/70 border border-gray-700 text-gray-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition" aria-pressed="false">
                    <span class="inline-flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-500 text-white text-[10px]">✓</span>
                    Diseño 3D
                  </button>
                  <button class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs bg-gray-800/70 border border-gray-700 text-gray-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition" aria-pressed="false">
                    <span class="inline-flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-500 text-white text-[10px]">✓</span>
                    Proyecto
                  </button>
                  <button class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs bg-gray-800/70 border border-gray-700 text-gray-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition" aria-pressed="false">
                    <span class="inline-flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-500 text-white text-[10px]">✓</span>
                    UI/UX
                  </button>
                  <button class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs bg-gray-800/70 border border-gray-700 text-gray-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition" aria-pressed="false">
                    <span class="inline-flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-500 text-white text-[10px]">✓</span>
                    Web
                  </button>
                  <button class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs bg-gray-800/70 border border-gray-700 text-gray-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-800 transition" aria-pressed="false">
                    <span class="inline-flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-500 text-white text-[10px]">✓</span>
                    Branding
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1 overflow-auto chat-scrollbar space-y-3 pr-1">
                <!-- User bubble -->
                <div class="flex justify-end">
                  <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-blue-600 text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm shadow">
                    Quiero un logo minimalista para cafetería, con semilla de café.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Assistant bubble -->
                <div class="flex justify-start">
                  <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 px-3 py-2 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm border border-gray-700">
                    Claro. ¿Prefieres tipografía serif o sans-serif? ¿Algún color clave (ej. marrón, crema, verde)?
                  </div>
                </div>
                <!-- User bubble -->
                <div class="flex justify-end">
                  <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-blue-600 text-white px-3 py-2 rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm shadow">
                    Sans-serif, tonos crema y marrón.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Assistant bubble -->
                <div class="flex justify-start">
                  <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 px-3 py-2 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm border border-gray-700">
                    Perfecto. Propondré una marca con semilla estilizada y tipografía limpia. Adjuntaré referencias.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Assistant bubble with image -->
                <div class="flex justify-start">
                  <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 px-3 py-2 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm border border-gray-700">
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                      <p>He creado un logo minimalista inspirado en una semilla de café con estilo naturista. La propuesta usa tonos crema y marrón con tipografía sans-serif limpia.</p>
                      <div class="bg-gray-900/50 rounded-lg p-3 border border-gray-600">
                        <img src={ImgLogoExample.src} alt="Logo minimalista para cafetería" class="w-full h-auto rounded-md shadow-sm" />
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2 text-center">Logo ejemplo: Cafetería minimalista</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Fake input -->
              <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                <input disabled placeholder="Escribe tu idea (simulación)" class="flex-1 bg-gray-800/70 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-gray-300 placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none" />
                <button disabled class="px-3 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg opacity-70 cursor-not-allowed">Enviar</button>
              </div>
              
              <!-- Botón para iniciar chat -->
              <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-700">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-2">El chat completo está disponible en la esquina inferior izquierda de la pantalla</p>
                <ButtonOpenChat context="diseño" class="w-full" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Dialog with iframe to simulate external chat continuation -->
<dialog id="chat-sim-dialog" class="chat-dialog w-[95vw] max-w-5xl rounded-xl p-0 bg-gray-900/95 text-white border border-gray-700">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-b border-gray-700">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Simulación de Chat</h3>
    <button id="close-chat-dialog" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white">✕</button>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full h-[70vh] bg-gray-900">
    <iframe srcdoc='<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Simulación</title><style>html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:#0b0f14;color:#cbd5e1;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto} .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;} .box{width:90%;max-width:900px;height:80%;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:12px;background:#0f172a22;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}</style></head><body><div class="wrap"><div class="box">Simulación de chat (iframe)</div></div></body></html>' class="w-full h-full" frameborder="0"></iframe>
  </div>
</dialog>

<script>
  const openBtn = document.getElementById('open-chat-dialog');
  const dialogEl = document.getElementById('chat-sim-dialog');
  const closeBtn = document.getElementById('close-chat-dialog');

  if (openBtn && dialogEl) {
    openBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      // @ts-ignore
      (dialogEl).showModal ? (dialogEl).showModal() : (dialogEl).show();
    });
  }
  if (closeBtn && dialogEl) {
    closeBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      // @ts-ignore
      (dialogEl).close();
    });
  }
</script>
